---
// Komoot mark. Inherits the text colour through a CSS mask.
---
<span class="komoot-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>

<style>
    .komoot-mark {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 1.15em;
        height: 1.15em;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        background: currentColor;
        mask: url('/assets/icons/komoot-logo.png') center / contain no-repeat;
    }
</style>
